name: Disability Discrimination Act (DDA)
description: SR 151.3 — Federal Act of 13 December 2002 on the Elimination of Discrimination against People with Disabilities (Disability Discrimination Act, DDA). Unofficial English mirror of the Fedlex consolidation of 1 July 2020. No legal force.
